{"id": "Q049", "question": "Who won Best Actor at the 95th ceremony and what was notable about the whole nominee field that year?", "information_need": "fact_lookup", "motivation": "conversation", "prior_familiarity": "unfamiliar", "scope": "multi_document", "answerable": true, "adversarial_kind": null, "required_sources": ["95th_Academy_Awards.html", "Brendan_Fraser.html"], "expected_sources": ["95th_Academy_Awards.html", "Brendan_Fraser.html", "Academy_Award_for_Best_Actor.html", "Austin_Butler.html", "Colin_Farrell.html", "Paul_Mescal.html", "Bill_Nighy.html"], "retrieved_sources": ["95th_Academy_Awards.html", "List_of_Academy_Award_records.html", "Academy_Award_for_Best_Picture.html"], "required_aspects": ["Brendan Fraser won Best Actor for playing Charlie in The Whale.", "Notably, for the first time since the 7th ceremony in 1935, all five Best Actor nominees were first-time nominees.", "The other nominees were Austin Butler (Elvis), Colin Farrell (The Banshees of Inisherin), Paul Mescal (Aftersun) and Bill Nighy (Living)."], "response": "Brendan Fraser won Best Actor for *The Whale* at the 95th Academy Awards [95th_Academy_Awards.html]. Notably, “for the first time since the 7th ceremony in 1935, all five Best Actor nominees were first-time nominees” [95th_Academy_Awards.html].", "closed_book_response": "At the 95th Academy Awards, **Brendan Fraser** won **Best Actor** for *The Whale*.\n\nWhat was notable about the nominee field that year was that it was seen as **especially strong and unusually diverse**, with the category featuring a mix of established stars and internationally recognized performances. It also stood out because it reflected a broader shift in recognition toward a wider range of films and acting styles, rather than being dominated by just one kind of “prestige” performance.", "correctness": "pass", "graded_correctness": "complete", "graded_correctness_score": 1.0, "covered_aspects": [1, 2, 3], "aspect_coverage": 1.0, "answer_relevance": "pass", "claims": [{"text": "Brendan Fraser won Best Actor for *The Whale* at the 95th Academy Awards.", "cited_source": "95th_Academy_Awards.html", "grounded": true, "citation_supported": true, "attributable_to_retrieval": false}, {"text": "For the first time since the 7th ceremony in 1935, all five Best Actor nominees were first-time nominees.", "cited_source": "95th_Academy_Awards.html", "grounded": true, "citation_supported": true, "attributable_to_retrieval": true}], "claim_count": 2, "graded_groundedness_score": 1.0, "faithfulness": "pass", "citation_support_rate": 1.0, "chunk_attribution_score": 0.5, "source_hit_at_k": 1, "source_recall_at_k": 0.5, "source_precision_at_k": 0.3333333333333333, "source_recall_strict": 0.0, "all_required_present": false, "response_quote_count": 1, "quote_fidelity_rate": 1.0, "quote_attribution_accuracy": 1.0, "citation_count": 1, "citation_precision": 1.0, "unsupported_citation_rate": 0.0, "refusal_outcome": "n/a", "answer_latency_seconds": 1.2826109000016004, "judge_latency_seconds": 4.503370599995833, "total_latency_seconds": 7.888800299988361, "input_tokens": 186043, "output_tokens": 357, "total_tokens": 186400, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.14113875}
